### register admin
POST {{url}}/api/accounts/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "Mungai",
    "email": "mungai@example.com",
    "password": "mungai123",
    "password2": "mungai123",
    "first_name": "Sheilla",
    "last_name": "Mungai",
