}

### Get user profile (requires token)
GET {{url}}/api/profiles/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Update user profile (requires token)
POST {{url}}/api/profiles/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

